---
title: What Each Button Does
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY: Load Demo

    READY --> RUNNING: Step (does ONE iteration)
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: Step (does ONE more iteration)
    RUNNING --> CONVERGED: Step (assignments repeated)
    READY --> CONVERGED: Run to End (loops Step automatically)
    RUNNING --> CONVERGED: Run to End (loops Step automatically)
    RUNNING --> NOT_CONVERGED: Step (hit 20 tries, still changing)

    CONVERGED --> [*]: Reset (back to original stickers and centres)
    NOT_CONVERGED --> [*]: Reset (back to original stickers and centres)
    RUNNING --> [*]: Reset (back to original stickers and centres)

    CONVERGED --> Saved: Save Final Wall (JSON download)
    Saved --> CONVERGED

    note right of CONVERGED
        Save Final Wall is ONLY
        turned on in this state
    end note

    note right of RUNNING
        Editing a sticker here
        wipes history and restarts
        from the ORIGINAL centres
    end note
